T1  - Strengthening mental health research outcomes through genuine partnerships with young people with lived or living experience: A pilot evaluation study.
A1  - Lee, Grace Yeeun
A1  - McKenna, Sarah
A1  - Song, Yun Ju C
A1  - Hutcheon, Alexis
A1  - Hockey, Samuel J
A1  - Laidler, Rachael
A1  - Occhipinti, Jo-An
