T1  - Conversational agents in health care: Scoping review of their behavior change techniques and underpinning theory.
A1  - Martinengo, Laura
A1  - Jabir, Ahmad Ishqi
A1  - Goh, Westin Wei Tin
A1  - Lo, Nicholas Yong Wai
A1  - Ho, Moon-Ho Ringo
A1  - Kowatsch, Tobias
