, PoespoprodjoJR, WilliamT, SimpsonJA, et al., ScottJ, KanyangararaM, NhamaA, MaceteE, MossWJ, SauteF, SeckI, FallI, FayeO, BaO, Tal-DiaA., SixpenceA, NkokaO, ChirwaGC, MilanziEB, ManganiC, MathangaDP, et al., SumariD, DillipA, NdumeV, MugasaJP, GwakisaPS, TairouF, DialloA, SyO, KoneA, MangaIA, SyllaK, et al., TalipouoA, NgadjeuCS, Doumbe-BelisseP, Djamouko-DjonkamL, Sonhafouo-ChianaN, KopyaE, et al., TesfahunegnA, BerheG, GebregziabherE, TesfayK, YohannesM, MarduF, BerheB, NegashH, The PMI VectorLink Project, Abt Associates Inc, UdonwaNE, GyuseAN, EtokidemAJ, VolkmanHR, WalzEJ, WanduragalaD, SchiffmanE, FroschA, AlpernJD, et al., World Health Organisation (WHO), World Health Organization, World Health Organization, World Health Organization, WorrallE, WereV, MatopeA, GamaE, OleweJ, MwambiD, et al., WotodjoAN, DoucoureS, DiagneN, SarrFD, ParolaP, GaudartJ, et al., YukichJ, StuckL, ScatesS, WisniewskiJ, ChackyF, FestoC, et al.
