T1  - Altruism (still) does not predict mating success in the Judd et al. (2022) data: A response to Arnocky et al. (2023).
T3  - Journal of Social, Evolutionary, and Cultural Psychology
A1  - Allen, Mark S
AI  - Allen, Mark S.; ORCID: https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5511-9680
