T1  - Objective hearing threshold identification from auditory brainstem response measurements using supervised and self-supervised approaches.
A1  - Thalmeier, Dominik
A1  - Miller, Gregor
A1  - Schneltzer, Elida
A1  - Hurt, Anja
A1  - deAngelis, Martin Hrabe
A1  - Becker, Lore
A1  - Muller, Christian L
A1  - Maier, Holger
