T1  - Evaluation of the trajectory of depression severity with ketamine and esketamine treatment in a clinical setting.
T3  - A.M.A. Archives of General Psychiatry, Archives of General Psychiatry
A1  - Nikayin, Sina
A1  - Rhee, Taeho Greg
